{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1737676800, "end_date": 1738367999, "month_true_total": 1074, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:28:07 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "186850593", "author": {"steamid": "76561199218931900", "personaname": "Ginger", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199218931900/", "num_games_owned": 1535, "num_reviews": 182, "playtime_forever": 7751, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3921, "last_played": 1758037012, "avatar": "d72c8ef0f183faf564b9407572d51751794acd15"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "非常好玩的刷子游戏。战场上的细节做的特别真实，烟雾会被风吹动，地上的雪能被火烤融化，喷气背包可以烧焦披风，氛围感拉满，尤其是虫族的设计，没见过更优秀的。我技术不太好一直在打难度8或难度7，再高就很吃力了。没有朋友一起开黑也可以玩，野排的环境不错，队友都挺团结友好，我打了几十个小时只遇到三四次恶意踢人的。新手第一个债券一定要买民主爆破，爆炸弩是轮椅武器。此外游戏有不少bug，键位偶尔会失灵不能疾跑和召唤战备，有时候还会莫名其妙卡在地形里。游戏的服务器也不大行经常容易卡顿。总体上来说是款瑕不掩瑜的好游戏。", "timestamp_created": 1738355501, "timestamp_updated": 1738355501, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186842339", "author": {"steamid": "76561198983158031", "personaname": "四爱女王转生浪漫世界这次也要狠狠中出监管者", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Wang0107/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 7712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 62, "playtime_at_review": 3387, "last_played": 1786964271, "avatar": "8084197be5d6e511b111d124ec625b761b11cb84"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "时隔一年再回来看，果然时间是剂良药，虽然早期烂，但后期修正好也拿了年度最佳，希望越来越好吧", "timestamp_created": 1738348104, "timestamp_updated": 1738348104, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "commen